{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "KT-0805Y",
 "kind": "led",
 "manufacturer": "KENTO (Hubei Kuangtong Electronics)",
 "title": "Yellow 0805 SMD chip LED, 2.0 × 1.25 × 0.85 mm, clear flat lens",
 "source": {
  "revision": "A.0, 2018-12-06",
  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "A single yellow surface-mount LED in the 0805 chip outline (2.0 × 1.25 mm), 0.85 mm high, with a clear flat lens. Driven at 20 mA it puts out 70 to 175 mcd with a dominant wavelength between 584 and 594 nm over a 120 degree viewing angle; forward drop is 1.8 to 2.4 V at 10 mA. Every part is graded into an intensity, a forward-voltage and a wavelength bin. It is RoHS compliant, made for pick-and-place and infrared reflow, and comes 3000 to a reel.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Luminous intensity IV",
